{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"02486790089d2746dc4295a8bf004d1cd4b168b72cd95ae730917e3ea0e72f67","ja":"そしてミニライブへ……！","zh":"然后前往迷你演唱会……！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"d4386fe8a9913487dba600c515104c5570e468b68b490ffc0bb6025a45f2efd9","ja":"撮影セット『宇宙艦』にいた観客が移動を始めた一方、\n『監獄星』では……","zh":"拍摄场景『宇宙舰』的观众开始移动，另一方面，\n『监狱星』这边……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"27a579a8c913cd97044d7440a2ccfa61020e9c73571fae865ed74fe55d03b8f4","ja":"「トモカ様～！　歌声を聞かせてください～！」\n「こっちにもっと人を集めてきた方がいいですか！？」","zh":"“朋花大人～！请让我们听听您的歌声吧～！”\n“要往这边多召集点人过来吗！？”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"1f02520376639d24a8dec73243e1d654511c01371b8ade19d60d4603254d1b90","ja":"（困りましたね～。そろそろミニライブの会場に\n移動しないといけないのですが……）","zh":"（真伤脑筋～。差不多该去迷你演出的会场\n了……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"45d357ed1c13385f1e662bb19a9921e2b2756d5207ee279b476a28084de334b0","ja":"（調子に乗って、盛り上げすぎてしまったようです。\n私の役で移動を促すのは不自然ですし……）","zh":"（好像有点得意忘形，把气氛炒得太过了。\n由我的角色来催促大家移动也不太自然……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"78ad495f43f6ff4ce6eb01d82ac4da21514092b0873afd139ebbd8e890f990ec","ja":"「……ウフフ。まだこんな所にいたの？　残念だった\nわね！　艦内のみんなはすでに移動済みよ！」","zh":"「……呵呵。还待在这种地方吗？真遗憾呢！\n舰内的大家已经转移了！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"ebddaa2242f7b8457d0dda1b93c9a1d2d69657c191a84f0c051f153a7d2ce95d","ja":"「あなたの精神波を受けないように\n避難させたの！」","zh":"“为了不接收你的精神波\n我让他们撤离了！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"7f0362d2e1a1c0e85ed1f07132b3730d9f11681eb627ad6cd445f1bb51adb02e","ja":"（……！　さすがこのみさんですね～。\nおかげで何とかなりそうです～）","zh":"（……！　真不愧是木美小姐呢～。\n多亏了您，总算有办法解决了～）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"f1fa1c178db740c189c66e2656a7cc99b4798ae7b35843a50954d1168780ebc4","ja":"「そうでしたか。ならば……あなた方の逃亡先に、\n旋律を響かせることにいたしましょう～！」","zh":"「原来如此。那么……就在你们逃亡的目的地，\n让旋律响彻吧～！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"c6cb541283414b0da66bd903d22a32bdd20fb4eb210a9ef8c59c5206c99e5530","ja":"「待ちなさい！\nそんなこと、私がさせないわ！」","zh":"「等一下！\n那种事，我绝不会让你得逞！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"d67ad1ecdb037369328afb8b4d4c0181599fa75269838fc773c55a873f279a87","ja":"「おい、俺たちもあっちに行こうぜ！！」","zh":"“喂，我们也去那边吧！！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"10daa725647f39ea22f3759215104382fa5bbd7e9bb64ce5638b7d35b15a1a2b","ja":"「うふっ♪　みなさん、こんなところにいたんですね？\n逃がしませんよ？」","zh":"呵呵♪　大家，原来你们在这种地方啊？\n别想逃哦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"970d9b81f34c0a11961de16790e8089798c1ca6f378816b4d55304861be7a996","ja":"「ここにいる全員に、トモカの力を浴びせてやろう。\n人形となって、我々のために戦え」","zh":"\"就让这里的所有人都沐浴在朋花的力量之下吧。\n变成人偶，为我们而战\"","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"363c405211c28d788d94b90ba1edf36d7dcf4f0dc5944db66501622f2e50091c","ja":"「待ちなさい！\nこれ以上、あなたたちの好きにはさせません！」","zh":"「等一下！\n我不会再让你们为所欲为了！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"f852a2686feb48448517e68dc5ec734d429349e473dcb55fc70560b927a2096d","ja":"「ええ！　それにチハヤだけじゃなくて……\n私とヒナタの歌でも、みんなを守ってみせるわ！」","zh":"「嗯！而且不仅是千早……\n用我和日向的歌声，也一定会保护大家的！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"fbea41d58d12017886eee282378316df8a19743a92f014610ba3db8ff729abe3","ja":"「うん、悪いけど本気出させてもらうよ！」","zh":"嗯，抱歉，我可要动真格的了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"77a38f3f226c139868c53c13d975be33cd82587bbeb97228c8c1eddf5dfdedac","ja":"「ふん。そうなると、さすがにトモカひとりに\n任せるのは荷が重いか……仕方ない」","zh":"「哼。既然如此，果然还是不能让桃子一个人\n来扛……没办法。」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"451ff0de007fcc2fce85de9c3f9d4a775ec52cb67db9f5504903e75699700c70","ja":"「私も貴様らに見せつけてやろう。\n歌の力を……！」","zh":"「我也让你们见识一下。\n歌声的力量……！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"a421b693fbe6da9cf4d456defb9dd73227eb75af8576539f33e5740495ea3813","ja":"「そうですね～。\nこちらも全力を出しましょう～。いきますよ……」","zh":"「说得也是～。\n这边也全力以赴吧～。要上了哦……」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1238.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"ee0f68f5c6fc339184ee0162d0ffd59cf1bea13f47bcc5676eaf7b97c8c1aeed","ja":"「「「「「響け、この旋律！」」」」」","zh":"「「「「「响彻吧，这旋律！」」」」」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
